    ],
    "description": "Build your mountain escape in the heart of the Vercors. From Gresse-en-Vercors to the Grand Veymont and Mont Aiguille, explore snowy forests and open meadows, develop a resort with 20 trails and nine lifts, and watch for shy foxes roaming between the trees.",
